# Database and file backups. These live in ~/dn-tracker-backups/ and must never
# enter the repository: a D1 export contains password hashes, live session
# tokens and every staff email address in the directory. Defensive rules in case
# a backup is ever copied into the tree.
dn-tracker-backups/
backups/
*.sql.gz
*.dump
d1-*.sql
d1-backup*
r2-backup*
r2-manifest.json
r2-keys.txt

# Client drops and third-party review documents. These are working material that
# arrives in the project root — source workbooks, bi-weekly report exports, and the
# external source-review PDFs. They are not part of the deliverable and some carry
# unreleased client data, so they must never be committed.
#
# Anchored to the repository root with a leading slash, so the shipped user guide
# at assets/DN_DC_Project_Tracker_User_Guide.pdf is unaffected.
/2026_0911 D&C Bi-Weekly Report Data.xlsx
/DN_Tracker_Source_Review_2026-09-15.pdf
/FW Design  Construction BiWeekly Report.pdf
/*.xlsx
/*.pdf
